xt":"They want to increase your taxes to the Cityto pay for childcare whether you have young // 7","x":299,"y":572,"w":1928,"h":58},{"text":"children or not.","x":300,"y":648,"w":309,"h":35},{"text":"They want to create a disaster/fire/earthquake community center.","x":299,"y":747,"w":1338,"h":44},{"text":"Does that make any sense to you?","x":302,"y":848,"w":696,"h":43},{"text":"No? Then vote NO on","x":302,"y":948,"w":428,"h":35},{"text":"3","x":2124,"y":636,"w":53,"h":45},{"text":"/o","x":2091,"y":721,"w":62,"h":47},{"text":"The ballot statements say the tax hike will fund a \"disaster relief facility...\", which begs the / 6","x":299,"y":1030,"w":1931,"h":61},{"text":"question: if the city council agrees this is important, why is it not in the current City Budget?","x":301,"y":1116,"w":1865,"h":44},{"text":"City budgets set their spending priorities and limits.","x":300,"y":1216,"w":1052,"h":44},{"text":"Their budget says that everything else in the current City budget is more important!","x":297,"y":1317,"w":1688,"h":44},{"text":"Do you agree?","x":302,"y":1417,"w":286,"h":43},{"text":"If yes? Then vote no on","x":302,"y":1517,"w":467,"h":44},{"text":"The SF Bay Area is already the most expensive region in the United States.","x":297,"y":1616,"w":1504,"h":44},{"text":"You must live within your means, and city of Belmont needs to do the same!","x":298,"y":1717,"w":1560,"h":43},{"text":"Send a message that Belmont must live within the city budget.","x":299,"y":1817,"w":1269,"h":44},{"text":"Vote NO on","x":296,"y":1917,"w":243,"h":36},{"text":"Silicon Valley Taxpayers Association's volunteers support taxpayers throughout San Mateo","x":298,"y":2118,"w":1841,"h":42},{"text":"County.","x":299,"y":2185,"w":156,"h":44},{"text":"For more information: www.SVtaxpayers.org","x":299,"y":2285,"w":902,"h":44},{"text":"8","x":2163,"y":1213,"w":34,"h":51}]}]}
